    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/908a0d0d136ffc0d2b0a704c51c98e72.poster.avif?t=1749263124\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/908a0d0d136ffc0d2b0a704c51c98e72.webm?t=1749263124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/908a0d0d136ffc0d2b0a704c51c98e72.mp4?t=1749263124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For Aerolite</strong> is a fun and exciting 2D platformer where you explore Xedron\u2019s mystical world through 100+ hand-crafted levels brimming with secrets. Meet vibrant characters, battle countless waves of fierce enemies, and conquer tricky challenges in a humorous, story-driven quest. With stunning 2D art and a beautiful soundtrack, every moment feels magical. Whether you\u2019re platforming through deep forests or fighting ferocious bosses in the chilly hills, <i>For Aerolite</i> delivers endless fun. Dive into this enchanting adventure today and uncover the wonders of this world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/a1e77bb7f94d8f82372d7a284f4cae2f.webp?t=1749263124\" width=640 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/e9f16e91ee35d81e330e1abe3ae4c3f1.poster.avif?t=1749263124\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/e9f16e91ee35d81e330e1abe3ae4c3f1.webm?t=1749263124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/e9f16e91ee35d81e330e1abe3ae4c3f1.mp4?t=1749263124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Meet a wide cast of characters who will either guide you, mock you, or teach you about the deep lore of Xedron. Most importantly, they'll offer the companionship you\u2019ll need to stay sane in such a strange world.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/06c380370d806ea18c3c5822005175fc.webp?t=1749263124\" width=640 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/1e1549fec6228de379b2f940fa89ad76.poster.avif?t=1749263124\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/1e1549fec6228de379b2f940fa89ad76.webm?t=1749263124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/1e1549fec6228de379b2f940fa89ad76.mp4?t=1749263124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Xedron is filled with those who prefer things their way\u2014and they won\u2019t let you pass without a fight. Stay alert and ready, because you'll need to defeat these deviants to achieve your goals.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/64df18ab157f95b6bee8c830a5aa686d.webp?t=1749263124\" width=640 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/bc7732373f1b508213e86b0d7c4767ad.poster.avif?t=1749263124\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/bc7732373f1b508213e86b0d7c4767ad.webm?t=1749263124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/bc7732373f1b508213e86b0d7c4767ad.mp4?t=1749263124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This world is designed to test both your reflexes and your mind. With a variety of puzzles and mysteries woven throughout Aspen\u2019s quest, you\u2019ll be constantly engaged and thinking on your feet.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/40544fbdb851e0a60e7ceb66873b0bd4.webp?t=1749263124\" width=640 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/8050a19722b7469e0af2a9ec8215ad21.poster.avif?t=1749263124\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/8050a19722b7469e0af2a9ec8215ad21.webm?t=1749263124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/8050a19722b7469e0af2a9ec8215ad21.mp4?t=1749263124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Aspen's journey is no small task. Explore over 100 handcrafted levels, each with unique quirks and surprises. Discover secrets that could drastically affect your path\u2014or unlock special content. Lose yourself in the flow state unlike anything you have ever experienced before.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/908a0d0d136ffc0d2b0a704c51c98e72.poster.avif?t=1749263124\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/908a0d0d136ffc0d2b0a704c51c98e72.webm?t=1749263124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/908a0d0d136ffc0d2b0a704c51c98e72.mp4?t=1749263124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For Aerolite</strong> is a fun and exciting 2D platformer where you explore Xedron\u2019s mystical world through 100+ hand-crafted levels brimming with secrets. Meet vibrant characters, battle countless waves of fierce enemies, and conquer tricky challenges in a humorous, story-driven quest. With stunning 2D art and a beautiful soundtrack, every moment feels magical. Whether you\u2019re platforming through deep forests or fighting ferocious bosses in the chilly hills, <i>For Aerolite</i> delivers endless fun. Dive into this enchanting adventure today and uncover the wonders of this world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/a1e77bb7f94d8f82372d7a284f4cae2f.webp?t=1749263124\" width=640 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/e9f16e91ee35d81e330e1abe3ae4c3f1.poster.avif?t=1749263124\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/e9f16e91ee35d81e330e1abe3ae4c3f1.webm?t=1749263124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/e9f16e91ee35d81e330e1abe3ae4c3f1.mp4?t=1749263124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Meet a wide cast of characters who will either guide you, mock you, or teach you about the deep lore of Xedron. Most importantly, they'll offer the companionship you\u2019ll need to stay sane in such a strange world.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/06c380370d806ea18c3c5822005175fc.webp?t=1749263124\" width=640 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/1e1549fec6228de379b2f940fa89ad76.poster.avif?t=1749263124\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/1e1549fec6228de379b2f940fa89ad76.webm?t=1749263124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/1e1549fec6228de379b2f940fa89ad76.mp4?t=1749263124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Xedron is filled with those who prefer things their way\u2014and they won\u2019t let you pass without a fight. Stay alert and ready, because you'll need to defeat these deviants to achieve your goals.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/64df18ab157f95b6bee8c830a5aa686d.webp?t=1749263124\" width=640 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/bc7732373f1b508213e86b0d7c4767ad.poster.avif?t=1749263124\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/bc7732373f1b508213e86b0d7c4767ad.webm?t=1749263124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/bc7732373f1b508213e86b0d7c4767ad.mp4?t=1749263124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This world is designed to test both your reflexes and your mind. With a variety of puzzles and mysteries woven throughout Aspen\u2019s quest, you\u2019ll be constantly engaged and thinking on your feet.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/40544fbdb851e0a60e7ceb66873b0bd4.webp?t=1749263124\" width=640 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/8050a19722b7469e0af2a9ec8215ad21.poster.avif?t=1749263124\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/8050a19722b7469e0af2a9ec8215ad21.webm?t=1749263124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574220/extras/8050a19722b7469e0af2a9ec8215ad21.mp4?t=1749263124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Aspen's journey is no small task. Explore over 100 handcrafted levels, each with unique quirks and surprises. Discover secrets that could drastically affect your path\u2014or unlock special content. Lose yourself in the flow state unlike anything you have ever experienced before.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
